      "statement": "pnpm run-local is the single-command way to run the whole stack: it installs dependencies, builds only typed-storage and the frontend bundle, and launches the dev server with --serve-frontend-assets so the backend serves the built frontend at localhost:8787, storing data under .wrangler (not meant for production).",
