      "id": "claim_65353a231abb453582122922a6e3244d",
      "statement": "Development mode is two processes: pnpm dev-server generates dev-only wrangler.dev.jsonc configs with dynamic service bindings, loads a gitignored root .dev.vars (KEY=VALUE lines, shell env takes precedence), and defers frontend-build watchers until wrangler is listening; pnpm dev-client runs the Vite dev server on port 3000, which proxies /api/client-errors, /blueprint-screenshot, and /api/site-logo to the backend host.",
