      "id": "claim_b05465d596ac476f8cb59cfe35596ac6",
      "statement": "The workspace's commands are vp-driven: pnpm build and types:check run vp run -r --cache build (type-check plus codegen, mostly noEmit since wrangler/vite bundle from source), pnpm test runs the root node --test scripts suite then per-package cached tests, pnpm lint chains vp lint plus type checks, and clean runs vp run -r clean.",
