    {
      "id": "claim_997848106e4544559bc226bfcdc1bb49",
      "statement": "The project maps itself onto an operating system: kernel = packages/workshop-backend, device drivers = packages/gatekeeper-*, shell = packages/workshop-frontend, processes = gadgets, executables = blueprints, with users and ACL-like sharing permissions — and the backend genuinely acts as a kernel by connecting users to programs and devices while sandboxing applications and enforcing access control.",
