      "statement": "The intended first-use scenarios are blueprint-driven outputs ('Make slides...'), from-scratch app creation, playing a game with the agent turn by turn, and integration-backed requests (an issue dashboard for a GitHub repo) that require the corresponding gatekeeper to be configured.",
